        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. The retention or release of non-career employees and probationary employees shall not be subject to Article 9 - Grievance Procedure or Article 3 - Arbitration Procedure of this Agreement except as provided for in Article 29 – Position Appointments, Section B. 2, Section B.6.a.1) and 2), Section B.6.b, and Section D.8. The retention or release of non-career employees and probationary employees is at the sole discretion of the University.",
