            "block_content": "2. When an action is taken by the University with respect to a limited employee which effectively terminates the limited employee during the term of his/her limited appointment and there are unique or unusual circumstances involved, the designated campus official, upon the specific request of the AFSCME Higher Education Division (Local 3299) Director, will discuss the action taken.",
